  (text "NOTES:"
    (at 12.70 248.92 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.524 1.524)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "8d677e48-b693-409a-90e5-00ba40daa838")
  )
  (text "1. E73 normal-voltage mode: VDD=VDDH=+3V3; DCCH floats (LDO, no DCDC inductor)."
    (at 12.70 255.27 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "f0815575-3ca5-4fcf-ab3b-dc18db6817e9")
  )
  (text "2. P0.18=nRESET via UICR PSELRESET (FW); APX809 MCU_RST + tact + SWD-10 share net."
    (at 12.70 260.35 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "a2b92177-d935-4874-a2c8-693743248d03")
  )
  (text "3. DFU: hold BOOT (P1.11 low) + tap RESET; UF2 double-tap RESET also enters bootloader."
    (at 12.70 265.43 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "706c1906-94ed-4712-9143-5547b07211bf")
  )
  (text "4. P0.09/P0.10 NFC pins unused; antenna keepout under E73 antenna end (layout)."
    (at 12.70 270.51 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "ff2e97f5-6d63-4756-9ca5-ecb4ffbb3f23")
  )
  (text "5. Plain crossings (no dot) unconnected by design: (227,140) (268,97) (262,163)."
    (at 12.70 275.59 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "91306e3b-a464-4ab8-9002-ed461dc3acc5")
  )
  (text "6. Y201 CL=9pF; C201/C202=12pF provisional, trim at bench. E73 footprint by layout job."
    (at 12.70 280.67 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "329ac012-93d6-4893-bd62-2b182b230b1e")
  )
